{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“A∞-空间”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"A∞-空间"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Stasheff 的 A∞-空间理论说明一个 H-空间 $X$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"环路空间","text":"环路空间"}},{"Plain":" (也即有"},{"Local":{"url":"分类空间","text":"分类空间"}},{"Plain":") 当且仅当它满足结合律的所有高阶"},{"Local":{"url":"融贯","text":"融贯"}},{"Plain":"同伦.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"环路空间","text":"环路空间"}},{"Plain":"自然构成 $A_\\infty$-空间.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Abel∞-群","text":"Abel ∞-群"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}